# DeFi vaults rule

> `.cursor/rules/do-not-touch.mdc` (`alwaysApply`) is the floor under this rule — its STOP
> list always wins. This rule adds DeFi-specific guardrails on top.

## Read first
- `docs/DEFI_CONTEXT.md`
- `docs/methodology/v1.0.md` (immutable once published — bump version, never edit in place)

## Must avoid
- Any I/O, `Date.now()`, `Math.random()`, `process.env`, `fetch`, or `prisma` inside
  `src/lib/engine/**`. The engine is a pure deterministic function — seed any PRNG, inject the clock.
- Leaking `apyMedianInternal` to **any** LP-facing surface. It is an internal diagnostic
  (`src/lib/engine/types.ts:123,135`) — never render it, never put it in a term sheet/chart label.
- Single-point APY anywhere. Always a range string (e.g. `"9.4-12.8%"`), never `"11%"`.
- Touching `contracts/**` — mainnet deploy is gated on a completed Spearbit audit + remediation.

## Validate before done
- `pnpm test src/lib/engine/__tests__` — must stay green, **including** `apy-spread-disclosure.test.ts`
  and `coverage.test.ts`.
- `pnpm typecheck`.
- USDC **6-decimal** vs share **18-decimal** discipline in `src/lib/onchain/vault.ts` — never mix
  units; convert explicitly at the boundary.

## STOP and ask before
- Tuning coverage thresholds in `src/lib/engine/coverage.ts` (healthy `1.25` / adequate `1.0` / floor `0.8`).
- Removing or narrowing the `MIN_APY_SPREAD_BPS` (50 bps) widening in `src/lib/engine/scenario.ts`
  (or `MIN_APY_SPREAD_V2`) — it guarantees a visible range.
- Editing `contracts/src/HearstYieldVault.sol` or `docs/audit/spearbit-prep-2026-05-26/abi-freeze.json`
  (ABI is frozen for audit).
- One vault inheriting another's AUM / assumptions / share-class numbers — vault id is a first-class
  key, no silent reuse (Model-B integrity).
- The "Results are not projected" copy bug (`src/components/vaults/invest-form.tsx:95-96,492`,
  `term-sheet-preview.tsx:183`, `distribution-form.tsx:314`) — confirm intent before fixing.

## Priority
P1
